# Testes manuais da API (T-018). Defina @token com o valor de Auth:ApiToken
# (dotnet user-secrets list --project src/MOps.Api). Não commite o valor.
@host = http://localhost:5011
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Health (público)
GET {{host}}/health

### Sem token (espera 401)
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### Projetos
GET {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Projeto teste", "description": "Criado pelo .http", "gitRepositoryUrl": null }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Projeto teste (editado)", "description": null, "gitRepositoryUrl": null }

### Sprints
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/sprints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sprint 1", "startDate": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "endDate": "2026-11-17T00:00:00Z" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/sprints/1/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/sprints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Work items
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/work-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Primeira task", "description": "**markdown**", "type": "Task", "status": "ToDo", "priority": "High", "sprintId": 1 }

###
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/work-items?status=ToDo&keyword=primeira
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/work-items/1/status
X-Api-Key: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Hook de commit (vincula ao #1)
POST {{host}}/api/commits/hook
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "commitHash": "abc123def456", "message": "Implementa X #1", "author": "Dev <dev@example.com>", "committedAt": "2026-11-03T12:00:00Z" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/work-items/1/commits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Limpeza (cascade apaga sprints, work items e commits)
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
